      skos:note "The organisation has reversed its Zypherion decision and is now adopting Meridian Analytics. Zypherion was found to have critical gaps in streaming ingestion; Meridian handles both batch and streaming natively. Migration remains Q3 2026. This supersedes the prior Zypherion adoption decision." .
  }
}
